        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Amazing place to shop for snowboard equipment. They have sales on current model equipment. Its been a while since i have gotten on a board. But when i walked in i was greeted and i met Sebastien, he walked me through the modern gear and was patient in asking me the right questions to find me the right gear.\n\nThank you guys for helping me get some new gear!",
        "time": 1706746119,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Louca M-L",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108527105519424389026/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWOKv34URPpwII8a7e6rpDS7P_xKQcwxI5Q0n6A8InekgUXayEf=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I came into the store with an odd job, a grip replacement on a big e-skate. Roch did some great work with a strip of longboard tape 👌",
        "time": 1714177219,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Julie Duquette",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103457938553400582532/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUm6iaTwzh9KzHwhvz4Joj0kMQxAiIeCTeodmoTEOY341WYOSdd=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Loic and Eloise took care of me and my VERY picky ( yet awesome) teenage daughter. We must have tried on 15 pairs of pants and were requesting stuff off the mannequins. No request was too big. They were super patient, funny and kind with us. I love this store for a gazillion reasons but now they have my heart :)",
        "time": 1702835550,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ill Ill",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115156995859861056593/reviews",
        "language": "en",
