        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 years ago",
        "text": "Love the environment of this store. I'm always greeted when walking in, and someone is always available when you need some assistance. They definitely provide great quality products! I have never had any problems with the purchases I have made here. Absolutely recommend coming here!",
